## API reference

| Part | Props | Description |
|------|-------|-------------|
| `Popover` | `default_open:` | The root; emits `ui--popover:open-change` with `{ open }`. |
| `PopoverTrigger` | `open_on_hover:`, `delay:` (300), `close_delay:` (0); block `{ \|trigger\| … }` | Toggles the popover. |
| `PopoverContent` | `side:` (`:bottom`), `align:` (`:center`), `side_offset:` (10, or 6 without an arrow), `align_offset:`, `arrow:` (`true`) | The card. |
| `PopoverTitle` / `PopoverDescription` | - | Label and describe the popup (`<h2>` / `<p>`). |
| `PopoverClose` | block `{ \|close\| … }` | Closes it. |

## Accessibility

- The trigger has `aria-haspopup="dialog"` / `aria-expanded`; the popup is a `role="dialog"` labelled by its title.
- Hover opening isn't available on touch or to keyboard users alone - the trigger still opens on click and Enter.
